Rym: Which does seem to be just on the rise everywhere, at least in the United States.

9
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:45,080
Rym: So today, on my way to work, there's someone playing TikTok videos super loudly on their phone on the Saipan train.

10
00:00:46,601 --> 00:00:50,580
Rym: And it stops, and it stutters to a stop every time we were between stations.

11
00:00:51,061 --> 00:01:00,280
Rym: And the dude just sat there, constantly trying to refresh it, staring at it, until we got to the next station and then it would sputter to life and be loud again.

12
00:01:00,522 --> 00:01:02,479
Rym: And then he just did this the entire ride.

13
00:01:02,825 --> 00:01:03,478
Rym: And then I get to work.

14
00:01:04,683 --> 00:01:06,620
Rym: And I go into work, and I go out to get some coffee.

15
00:01:07,201 --> 00:01:14,500
Rym: And there's someone sitting in the Starbucks just watching a whole movie on their iPad, just sitting there super loud, and nobody is sitting near them.

16
00:01:15,423 --> 00:01:15,998
