17
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:19,646
Rym: And there's a dude watching TikToks.

18
00:01:19,726 --> 00:01:26,960
Rym: that were all people screaming, just as loud as possible, in the Le Penco to the end, so I just left.

19
00:01:27,563 --> 00:01:30,880
Rym: And now, on my way home, there were two different people watching.

20
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:35,600
Rym: One was watching videos, and one was playing extremely loud reggaeton on their phones on the Saipan train.

21
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:44,480
