22
00:01:45,441 --> 00:01:50,656
Scott: Yeah, well, TikTok is constantly loading, but Spotify has huge cache, right?

23
00:01:50,736 --> 00:01:51,900
Scott: Or Apple Music, right?

24
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:59,000
