Rym: One time when I politely asked, but I didn't actually even ask the guy to turn it down.

40
00:03:15,229 --> 00:03:18,156
Rym: I just asked him like, "Hey, do you need any help with your phone?

41
00:03:18,476 --> 00:03:19,800
