54
00:04:11,690 --> 00:04:14,194
Scott: Me and my ten friends are bothered by your loud music.

55
00:04:14,655 --> 00:04:16,678
Scott: We are asking nicely for the last

56
00:04:16,738 --> 00:04:16,959
