00:08:12,802 --> 00:08:38,039
Rym: don't know, it's stuck in my craw that the rise in public antisocial behavior that I encounter personally, backed up by the anecdata of people in my close social circles, implies a worrying trend about the general state of hand wave around, but I think the general state of hand wave around was not great anyway, and this is a symptom, it's nothing

