Scott: GeekNights is recorded live with no studio and no audience.

662
00:58:43,950 --> 00:58:47,410
Scott: But unlike those other late shows, it's actually recorded at night.

663
00:58:47,851 --> 00:59:05,930
Rym: And the Patreon patrons for this episode of GeekNights are Alan Joyce, Link Iggi, Dread Lily, Tenebrae, Case, Care, Makes Music, Chris, Hadad, Christopher, Ore, Clinton, Walton, Finn, Joel Hayes, Penny Reimer, Rebecca Dunn, Sam Erickson, Shervin Von Hurl, and a bunch of people who are below that sweet five USD per month threshold.

664
00:59:06,470 --> 00:59:12,870
Rym: I leave you tonight, short and sweet, with something that you really should have seen coming if you actually listened to the episode.

665
00:59:13,910 --> 00:59:15,190
Scott: Greetings to whoever.

666
00:59:15,290 --> 00:59:18,650
Scott: for some reason you so choose.

